"Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn5le08ob05re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Talking About the Future", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the auxiliary <span class=\"strong\">will</span> to talk about actions in the future.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Look at the chart for information on how to form sentences with <span class=\"strong\">will</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Form\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Structure\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Affirmative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">will</span> + base form of the verb (long form)<br> <span class=\\\"italic\\\">'ll </span>+ base form of the verb (short form)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Negative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">will <span class=\\\"strong\\\">not</span> </span> + base form of the verb (long form)<br> <span class=\\\"italic\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">won't</span> </span>+ base form of the verb (short form)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Interrogative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Will</span> or <span class=\\\"italic\\\">Won't</span> + subject + base form of the verb. (yes-no question)<br> Wh-word + <span class=\\\"italic\\\">will</span> or <span class=\\\"italic\\\">won't </span>+ subject + base form of the verb (wh-question)\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "I will board the hot-air balloon. (Affirmative)", "type": "example"}, {"content": "We won't be going on the hot-air balloon. (Negative)", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Why won't we go on? (Interrogative)<br/> <br/> ", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Quantifiers ", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use a quantifier before a noun to indicate the amount or number of an item.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You use quantifiers to talk about the quantity or amount of something.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Quantifiers can be used with countable and uncountable nouns. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "These are quantifiers you can use with countable nouns:<ul><li>many</li><li> several <li> few/a few of <li> a number of <li>  a large/great number of", "type": "text"}, {"content": "There are <span class=\"strong\">many</span> things to do at the camp. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "There is <span class=\"strong\">a large number of</span> plants there. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I want to take <span class=\"strong\">several</span> photos.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "hot air balloon ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a large balloon filled with hot air used for carrying people up into the sky ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm looking forward to getting on the hot air balloon.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le08ob05aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about things you do when you travel.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to overlook", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to have a view of something from above ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The mountain overlooks the whole town.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le08ob05aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "acre ", "type": "name"}, {"content": " a unit for measuring area, equal to 4047 square meters ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: There are acres of empty land here. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le08ob05aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "plain", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a large area of flat dry land ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You can see the plains from the top of the mountain.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le08ob05aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "dune ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a hill made of sand ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: We will visit the dunes on our tour.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le08ob05aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "surrounding ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "near or around a specific place ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We want to explore the surrounding areas.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le08ob05aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "helicopter tour", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a trip around an area on a helicopter ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Today, we are going on a helicopter tour of Botswana. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le08ob05aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "nature drive ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a trip in a vehicle around the wild  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I went on a nature drive with the tour guide.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le08ob05aud08", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "rock painting ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "artwork created on rock many years ago  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We saw many rock paintings on a tour.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le08ob05aud09", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "vantage point ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a good position from which you can see something ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: From my vantage point, I could watch the animals.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le08ob05aud10", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Imagine you are planning a trip for your friend.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Choose a place for them to go.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Go on the Internet and research things they can do at this place. Make a list of these things.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Use your list and write a paragraph (6 to 7 sentences) using the Simple Future tense.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Proofread your paragraph. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read it aloud to your friend.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I write about travel and things to do on a trip.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I use the Simple Future tense.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I read my paragraph aloud.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn5le08ob05re2img01.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn5le08ob05re2img01.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "Our Namibian safari will start in Windhoek."}, {"image": "engenn5le08ob05re2img01.jpg", "time": "4000", "id": 2, "text": "On Day 1, we will board the hot-air balloon. Our first stop will be the Sossusvlei Wilderness Camp. It's at the top of a mountain overlooking several acres of open plains. There will be many things to see including the Sossusvlei Dunes, and a number of desert plants and animals."}, {"image": "engenn5le08ob05re2img02.jpg", "time": "23500", "id": 3, "text": "On Day 3, we'll take a helicopter tour over the dunes and a few surrounding areas.  We'll stop at Swakopmund, tour the town and then head to Damaraland Camp."}, {"image": "engenn5le08ob05re2img03.jpg", "time": "35000", "id": 4, "text": "On Day 4, we will go on a nature drive and a visit to the rock paintings."}, {"image": "engenn5le08ob05re2img03.jpg", "time": "40000", "id": 5, "text": "On Day 5, we'll depart from Damaraland and head to Ongava Lodge, the perfect vantage point overlooking Etosha National Park. You can sit and watch a great number of animals drink from the watering hole."}, {"image": "engenn5le08ob05re2img02.jpg", "time": "54000", "id": 6, "text": "From Ongava, we'll fly back to Windhoek."}], "audiosrc": "engenn5le08ob05re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le08ob05re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Vocabulary and Grammar", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "I can talk about travel and things to do on a trip.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can talk about or report on actions, events or people in the future. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can use words to describe specific quantities. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Find Namibia on a world map. ", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "How far is it from the country you live in?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type"